## CELL FACTS

Cell 金_水. Core element Metal, energy element Water. Law: Metal feeds Water (金生水: dew beads on the cold blade). Relative to the core the energy is the fed, so Water is this core's Expression.
- Family personas and ruled domains (the cost domain: the cost is named in these words or in ordinary life, work only where a domain word is work; the definition names one drive per persona, E8): The Artisan: Expression, Enjoyment, Children · The Virtuoso: Talent, Performance, Defiance
- mechanism.classic (the sourced epigraph): "少陰之氣，銷金為水"
- mechanism.base: [REDACTED: the target field]
- mechanism.catalyst_turn: [REDACTED: the target field]
- mechanism.friction_turn: "Run heavy, the flow turns to flood: output for its own sake, saying instead of shaping. The flood drinks the blade that feeds it. Cut the noise and the water clears."
- function.definition_catalyst: [REDACTED: the target field]
- function.definition_friction: "Water is your Expression, and as a friction, it is output with no banks. Talent spills wherever it lands, into snacks and scrolling, into remarks that cut deeper than intended, into half-made things. Nothing is wrong, exactly. That is the problem. The spill keeps absorbing the effort your best work was waiting for."
- function.advise_catalyst: [REDACTED: the target field]
- function.advise_friction: "A river with no banks is a swamp, even a pleasant one. Give your talent one container: one project, one hour, the same time every day. Let yourself be bothered on purpose by one thing that matters. And make the treat follow the work, never replace it."
- cta_verdict: [REDACTED: the target field]
- carry.catalyst: [REDACTED: the target field]
- carry.friction: {"clause":"The flow turns to flood: output for its own sake, saying instead of shaping.","remedy":"Cut the noise and the water clears."}
- carry.wide: {"clause":"There is no shortage of Water in you, the channel that lets the blade breathe.","remedy":"Say it while it is fresh. Ship the draft."}
- carry.missing: {"clause":"No channel out: much forged, nothing said, the pressure with nowhere to go.","remedy":"Borrow a channel: write it down, say it once."}
- carry.spared: {"clause":"Water runs absent, and nothing spills: the edge keeps its shape and its silence.","remedy":"Keep it. Speak on purpose, not on reflex."}
- carry.thin: {"clause":"Water runs thin and unwanted: a trickle of output, easy to keep clean.","remedy":"A trickle is enough. Keep it clean."}
- carry.excess: {"clause":"Too much water sinks the metal: output floods the work, saying everything and shaping nothing.","remedy":"Cut the flow. Finish one thing in silence."}

The classical excess idiom for this cell (say it in English in carry.excess, never quote it): 金能生水，水多金沉 (泄之太过, the Expression door).
The eight wide openers (a carry.wide clause opens with one; no core repeats one across its wanted energies): "{Element} is one thing you never run short of" · "{Element} is easy for you to reach" · "{Element} is all around you" · "You have plenty of {Element}" · "{Element} is already here in plenty" · "You are well supplied with {Element}" · "You were given plenty of {Element}" · "There is no shortage of {Element} in you".
Fields shown above that are not the target are context for the repetition law (no four-word run shared with them) and for the cut law; do not rewrite them.

## CELL FACTS

Cell 水_食神 (Water carrying The Artisan). Persona The Artisan (食神). Definition line: "Output that flows from you, giving that feels like being". Keyword Flow, charge gentle, poles catalyst Grace / friction Coasting. Family function: Expression. Cost dimension: giving that feels like being; worth tangled with what is made. Arena: craft, hands, the table, warmth of making, fed and feeding. Classical portrait: ease and appetite; output that flows without assertion; generous, content, prone to drift and indulgence. Ruled domains: Expression, Enjoyment, Children. Sibling (other polarity of the family): 伤官.
Element arena: Water (depth, current, tide, rain, spring, flow). dm_element (which core reads this cell): Metal. structural_interaction seed: "Metal generating Water same-polarity — precision as natural source of flowing depth".
- k2_overview: "Your Water moves as the Artisan: a spring that feeds everything downstream. Your output flows, words, ideas, comfort, care, without visible effort, and people drink from it more than you notice. You nourish by permeating: the right thing said gently, the mood eased, the story that waters a dry week."
- k2_functional: "Your expression pours: fluent, warm, endlessly refilled. Writing and talk both come as flow."
- adj_chips: {"friction":["Drifting","Indulgent","Unmoved"],"catalyst":"[REDACTED: the words under test]"}
- k2_domain_readings: {"Expression":"Your expression is the stream itself: writing, conversation, comfort flowing daily. Volume is natural to you, so add channels: publish, record, send. Water that reaches others is what turns gift to harvest.","Enjoyment":"You enjoy in gentle currents: long baths, slow music, conversation into the night. Honor these as necessities. A spring that is never let pool goes brackish.","Children":"With the young you nourish invisibly: the listening, the softening, the words that raise them without their noticing. They will quote you for life, usually without knowing whom they are quoting."}
- fn_reading.catalyst.ledger (three rows, index-aligned to adj_chips.catalyst; authored order is significance order):
  - row 0: [REDACTED: the target row]
  - row 1: [REDACTED: the target row]
  - row 2 "Easygoing": {"drive":"Your tempo stays loose where other people clench, which is temperament rather than effort. Pressure has never found your dial, and around you it loses track of everyone else’s too. Ease like yours cannot be faked under load. Its realness is what makes it contagious.","cost_self":"The flight is cancelled, the line is furious, and somehow you are at the counter making the gate agent laugh while the rebooking happens. Nothing about it was strategy. Loose is just the setting you run at, and pressure has never found the dial.","cost_others":"Tense people collect near you without being invited, the way cold hands find a warm mug. Whatever they came in carrying weighs less within the hour. You rarely notice the effect, which is precisely why it works, and precisely why nobody believes you when you shrug."}
- Sibling cell 水_伤官 chips (nothing you write may fit the sibling): {"catalyst":["Silver-tongued","Inspired","Free-flowing"],"friction":["Toxic","Mocking","Uncontainable"]}
- Sibling cell 水_伤官 catalyst row 0 drive passage, for the sibling test on the tension (this row must name a different either-or): "Words obey you the way water obeys gravity, finding every gap and pouring through beautifully. You talk people into things, out of things, and around things, and they enjoy the ride even when they can see the technique. Persuasion this smooth stopped being learned long ago. It flows."

## CELL FACTS

Cell 水_伤官 (Water carrying The Virtuoso). Persona The Virtuoso (伤官). Definition line: "Cross-current output, brilliance made of what it meets". Keyword Brilliance, charge fierce, poles catalyst Spark / friction Pushback. Family function: Expression. Cost dimension: brilliance against the grain; shining reads as defiance. Arena: the stage, spark, off-script, the note held too long. Classical portrait: brilliance and defiance; output that exceeds its container; 傲物气高, cannot hold its tongue. Ruled domains: Talent, Performance, Defiance. Sibling (other polarity of the family): 食神.
Element arena: Water (depth, current, tide, rain, spring, flow). dm_element (which core reads this cell): Metal. structural_interaction seed: "Metal generating Water cross-polarity — precision producing depth that exceeds its container".
- k2_overview: "Your Water moves as the Virtuoso: a current too clever for its banks. You express in floods of insight, subversive, fluid, impossible to police, the writer between the lines, the wit that erodes pomposity by morning. Nothing contains you long. The art is choosing what your torrent carves next."
- k2_functional: "Your expression flows subversive and quotable, satire and insight braided into one current."
- adj_chips: {"friction":["Toxic","Mocking","Uncontainable"],"catalyst":"[REDACTED: the words under test]"}
- k2_domain_readings: {"Talent":"Your talent is fluid genius: writing, strategy, humor, any craft where thought must flow around form. It resists containers and needs them. Choose loose ones, essays, seasons, series, and pour.","Performance":"You perform by currents: the essay that spreads, the remark that travels. Your stage is wherever words flow. Publish more, polish less. Rivers are judged by movement, not by stillness.","Defiance":"Your defiance dissolves things: authority mocked into smallness, rules outlived rather than fought. It is elegant and it accumulates enemies slowly. Now and then, defend something openly. It sweetens the water."}
- fn_reading.catalyst.ledger (three rows, index-aligned to adj_chips.catalyst; authored order is significance order):
  - row 0: [REDACTED: the target row]
  - row 1 "Inspired": {"drive":"Ideas arrive in you like spring water, from somewhere underground and always moving. Mid-shower, mid-sentence, mid-commute: the notion appears whole, strange, and usually good. You have learned to keep something to write with everywhere, including the glovebox and the shower wall.","cost_self":"The campaign that carried the year was dictated into your phone at a red light, complete with the tagline, in ninety seconds. The agency had been circling it for a month. You apologized for the audio quality. Nobody heard the apology over the applause.","cost_others":"Colleagues have learned to schedule brainstorms around your presence, then pretend they did not. With you in the region, the whiteboard fills differently. Where the ideas come from, nobody knows, including you. That they keep coming is the only data anyone needs."}
  - row 2 "Free-flowing": {"drive":"Your expression pours, and it comes out with an edge already in it. The take nobody dared say, the phrasing that turns the meeting, the line too good to keep: it all flows at speed, brilliant first, considerate later, if later gets a turn.","cost_self":"The hot take you typed in one pass, no drafts, went further than anything the team spent weeks polishing. Half the industry loved it, a client quoted it back, and legal asked one careful question. You would write it again, faster.","cost_others":"People forward what you say with commentary attached: brilliant, careful, look at this. Your one-pass writing outperforms other people’s fourth drafts, publicly, which wins you fans and a folder in somebody’s records. Nobody is neutral about your output. That is the point of it."}
- Sibling cell 水_食神 chips (nothing you write may fit the sibling): {"catalyst":["Fluent","Nourishing","Easygoing"],"friction":["Drifting","Indulgent","Unmoved"]}
- Sibling cell 水_食神 catalyst row 0 drive passage, for the sibling test on the tension (this row must name a different either-or): "Expression comes to you the way walking comes to other people, without assembly or rehearsal. What costs everyone else three drafts costs you a breath, and the ease is invisible from inside. You do not know where the words are before they arrive. They just do."

Chart: golden 庚 The Blade, 1995-04-29 18:00 Beijing (Overfueled; Earth 33 / Wood 33 / Metal 23 / Water 6 / Fire 5). Water runs 6%: catalyst, thin. The page shows the catalyst pole; its state line is the catalyst turn. Ledger rows shown: row 0 食神 · the drive passage, row 1 食神 · the cost_self passage, row 2 伤官 · the cost_others passage (one angle per row, rotating drive · cost_self · cost_others: the drive, the cost to the reader, the cost to others).
